      <div><span class="aside-label" data-i18n="presentation">Presentation</span><a class="aside-action" href="https://www.canva.com/design/DAHaPYk-muw/vKiQv-IbF66gTq9H_S2Cpw/edit" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-i18n="presentationLink">Open in Canva <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      <div><span class="aside-label" data-i18n="service">Sunday service</span><a class="aside-action" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IbOf7E7QimI&amp;t=4560" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-i18n="serviceLink">Watch the preaching on YouTube <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p data-i18n="serviceTime">Sermon segment: 01:16:00–02:10:00</p></div>
      <div><span class="aside-label" data-i18n="facebook">Facebook Live</span><p data-i18n="facebookUnavailable">A separate Facebook Live link is not available. Watch the service on YouTube above.</p></div>
